            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method and machine (2) for the surface decoration of a basic article (3) comprising ceramic material and having a surface (4); a printing assembly (16) applies an adhesive material (17) digitally and selectively onto a defined area (18) of the surface (4); a treatment assembly (20) deposits a powder material (21) digitally and selectively in the defined area (18); and the powder material (21) in excess arranged on the basic article (3) is removed.</p>
            </abstract>
